			<p class="country-flag-in-modal">🇨🇦 </p>
			<h2 class="name">Canada</h2>
			<p class="details">The majority of our hog production operations are located close to home. Southern Manitoba (where HyLife began in 1994) hosts many of our barns, three feed mills, transportation fleet hub, and corporate head office. <br>
<br>
Our flagship pork plant in Neepawa, MB has been designed to meet robust and stringent specifications for global customers. Hog production operations also span into Eastern Saskatchewan, as do genetics and R&D programs in Québec.</p>
						
