			<h2 class="name">China</h2>
			<p class="details">The HyLife Shanghai office handles almost all of HyLife’s pork products exported to China. With 16 dedicated staff, HyLife Shanghai has successfully established strategic relationships with major processors and wholesalers in more than 15 provinces. <br>
<br>
Our superior product qualities are sought after in value-added markets, allowing us to meet China’s growing demand for high-quality, safe food.</p>
						
