			<p class="country-flag-in-modal">🇯🇵 </p>
			<h2 class="name">Japan</h2>
			<p class="details">HyLife Pork Asia, headquarted in Tokyo, Japan, is a symbol of HyLife’s commitment to the Japanese market. The HyLife Pork Asia office and HyLife Pork Table restaurant and brand shop are both located in the affluent Daikanyama neighbourhood - a perfect location to showcase HyLife’s premium pork products.<br>
<br>
In addition to being a full-scale restaurant, HyLife Pork Table provides cooking workshops for consumers and retailers. These demonstrations have established that HyLife is dedicated to producing pork products that are second to none.<br>
<br>
By having a presence in Japan, HyLife is able to work closely with customers to provide products equal in quality to domestic Japanese pork. Our Taste and Trust approach has allowed HyLife Pork to be widely enjoyed across Japan.</p>
